.B tk update
edits the fields supplied on the command line. Omitted fields keep their
Repository Store values.
.PP
Title input trims only outer ASCII spaces and tabs. Body input treats a
leading @ as literal text. The two body sources are mutually exclusive.
.PP
Body input preserves whitespace and line endings. An empty body, file, or
input stream clears the body. NUL is rejected in both title and body.
.PP
Title and body edits can be combined with
.BR \-\-priority ,
.BR \-\-parent ,
or
.BR \-\-no\-parent
for Tickets. All requested edits and their Mutations commit together in the
Repository Store. Backend delivery uses complete title/body snapshots and
separate relationship Mutations.
